e you  don't just stop and wait and burn keep  moving forward I think would be a key  and finally success  [Music]  my challenge with a lot of people is  getting them to believe in themselves  you can do it like they said I had to  change my attitudes that I was always  gonna be that farm girl that was wanting  people to love me but you can change we  are all selfish people we're our own  worst enemy at times but if we're  consistent I think we can all get them  money as emotionless money is a tool  that you can use for various things the  point for us isn't that you need to have  one dream the point is that you can  dream in a variety of ways we lived a  lifestyle that fit our dreams and  enabled us to get to the point where we  are today it is possible to live your  dreams and to be excited and to  enthusiast if we pursue life and you  will achieve what you want if you want  it bad enough  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

